#. ~ Description of "Riemann shell"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/energy_shield.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/energy_shield.json
msgid ""
"A thin shell of altered reality containing enormous electromagnetic "
"potential, such that it might behave as a solid object under certain "
"conditions.  A Riemann shell can defend against a wide variety of physical "
"and energy attacks, but can be overwhelmed and forced to collapse into deadly"
" radiation with prolonged assault."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/energy_shield.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/energy_shield.json
