#. ~ Description of "rocket pack"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/jetpacks.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/jetpacks.json
msgid ""
"A back mounted rocket pack, its well worn superalloy nozzles seem to suggest "
"great age.  Units like this one are rarely used by elite military forces and "
"by scavenger-explorers hoping to find high value salvage.  Not powerful "
"enough to enable true flight within a gravity well, but it may still be used "
"to perform short jumps and air-dashes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "rocket pack"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/jetpacks.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/jetpacks.json
msgid "The rocket pack fuel tank.  Holds up to 10 liters of pressurized fuel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ballistic collar"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_armor.json
msgid ""
"Front and back nylon collar assemblies with armor inserts for neck "
"protection.  Designed to be attached to heavy military body armor."
msgstr ""

