#. ~ Description of "ramen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/flesh.json
msgid ""
"Ramen's adaptability to dried and preserved ingredients make it a staple in "
"the culinary landscapes of frontier outposts and shipping crews alike.  Any "
"spaceport worth visiting has a local ramen tradition of its own, and here the"
" dish is slightly acidic, with a sweet aftertaste produced by the break-down "
"of alien proteins."
msgstr ""

