#. ~ Description of "synthetic blood"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/medicine.json
msgid ""
"A chalk white blood analogue for emergency medical use.  Far more efficient "
"at oxygenation than natural blood, it can also be used as a general "
"performance enhancer.  Once injected, it will be metabolized or otherwise "
"expunged from the body in around 8 hours."
msgstr ""

